+# sms-vita's SMS_VITA_LTO=2 (link-time optimisation for everything): the
+# game's code is optimised as a whole on its own, into one plain object (a
+# relocatable link with -flinker-output=nolto-rel) that replaces the
+# archive's members, before the rename below: objcopy cannot rename symbols
+# inside LTO bytecode (the first such build crashed at start, a std::string
+# in the Vita's start-up taken by the game's operator new before any heap
